=== unclosed brackets: the error points at the place where the parser stopped, and every bracket
=== that is never closed is listed with its own position
--- SELECT a FROM (SELECT b FROM (SELECT c FROM (SELECT count(* AS cnt FROM numbers(10)) t3) t2) t1
Syntax error: failed at position 68 (FROM): FROM numbers(10)) t3) t2) t1. Unmatched parentheses: '(' at position 15 is never closed. (SYNTAX_ERROR)
--- SELECT count(* FROM numbers(10)
Syntax error: failed at position 16 (FROM): FROM numbers(10). Unmatched parentheses: '(' at position 13 is never closed. (SYNTAX_ERROR)
--- SELECT (1, 2
Syntax error: failed at position 13 (end of query): . Unmatched parentheses: '(' at position 8 is never closed. (SYNTAX_ERROR)
--- SELECT [1, 2
Syntax error: failed at position 13 (end of query): . Unmatched parentheses: '[' at position 8 is never closed. (SYNTAX_ERROR)
--- SELECT ((1)
Syntax error: failed at position 12 (end of query): . Unmatched parentheses: '(' at position 8 is never closed. (SYNTAX_ERROR)
--- SELECT x FROM (SELECT arrayMap(y -> y, [1]
Syntax error: failed at position 43 (end of query): . Unmatched parentheses: '(' at position 15, '(' at position 31 are never closed. (SYNTAX_ERROR)

=== a closing bracket that does not close anything names what it fails to match
--- SELECT 1)
Syntax error: failed at position 9 ()): ). Unmatched parentheses: ')' at position 9 has no matching opening bracket. (SYNTAX_ERROR)
--- SELECT [1)
Syntax error: failed at position 10 ()): ). Unmatched parentheses: ')' at position 10 does not match '[' at position 8. (SYNTAX_ERROR)
--- SELECT (1]
Syntax error: failed at position 10 (]): ]. Unmatched parentheses: ']' at position 10 does not match '(' at position 8. (SYNTAX_ERROR)
--- CREATE TABLE t a UInt32, b UInt32) ENGINE = MergeTree ORDER BY a
Syntax error: failed at position 16 (a): a UInt32, b UInt32) ENGINE = MergeTree ORDER BY a. Unmatched parentheses: ')' at position 34 has no matching opening bracket. (SYNTAX_ERROR)

=== a mistyped keyword is named explicitly instead of being buried in the list of alternatives
--- SELEgT 1
Syntax error: failed at position 1 (SELEgT): SELEgT 1. Maybe you meant: SELECT.
--- ESLECT 1
Syntax error: failed at position 1 (ESLECT): ESLECT 1. Maybe you meant: SELECT.
--- CREAT TABLE t (x UInt8) ENGINE = Memory
Syntax error: failed at position 1 (CREAT): CREAT TABLE t (x UInt8) ENGINE = Memory. Maybe you meant: CREATE.
--- SELECT 1 WHERE 1 ANF 2
Syntax error: failed at position 18 (ANF): ANF 2. Maybe you meant: AND.

=== but a name that merely looks like a keyword is not reported as a typo
--- SELECT 1 hits hits
Syntax error: failed at position 15 (hits): hits.
--- SELECT 1 orders orders
Syntax error: failed at position 17 (orders): orders.
--- SELECT 1 an1 an1
Syntax error: failed at position 14 (an1): an1.
